      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "That's all I need, thank you. From what you've told me and what I found, I think we're dealing with jaundice with a cause we still need to find at this stage. It could also be a gallstone blocking the bile duct, so so we'll keep that open.",
