      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "I want a hepatitis screen done, that's for jaundice. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more. Please avoid alcohol completely and don't take any painkillers except paracetamol, and not much of that. Let's get you seen by a liver specialist, I'll arrange the letter. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose",
